WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.317 --> 00:00:04.191
- You better hit those drums, Lester!

00:00:04.191 --> 00:00:05.250
(Kelly laughs)
(audience clapping)

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:06.150
Welcome back.

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:08.490
Some of my favorite
stories I saved for last.

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:09.554
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:09.554 --> 00:00:12.774
(upbeat music)

00:00:12.774 --> 00:00:14.700
I love this next video

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.130
which comes from my home state of Texas.

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:19.080
Seriously, the Fort
Worth Police Department

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:23.160
created probably the greatest
recruitment video of all time.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:24.480
Just look.

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:25.590
- Well howdy folks.

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:27.000
Officer Big B here.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.560
Are you looking for a new job?

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:29.880
Are you ready to try something new

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.370
that'll make a difference at
doing something really great?

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:34.830
Well, come join us here at the
Fort Worth Police Department.

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:36.720
We're hiring and we got it all.

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.900
We got your patrol vehicles,
we got your explorers,

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:44.430
we got your Tahoes, and we
even got your F-150 Responders.

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:45.900
Say what?

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.780
Now currently, you may not have squat,

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:51.390
but come join us here at the
Fort Worth Police Department

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:53.886
because we've got SWAT.

00:00:53.886 --> 00:00:56.850
- You gotta see the whole video.

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:58.080
Officer Big B,

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:00.570
also known as Officer Buddy Calzada

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:02.010
is on the line right now.

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:03.989
Oh my God, I love you so much.

00:01:03.989 --> 00:01:07.181
(audience cheering)

00:01:07.181 --> 00:01:08.067
- Oh boy, it was really fun.

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:11.400
- You are like my
favorite what I'm liking.

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:13.410
Okay, where did you get this idea?

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:15.705
Obviously, from a car
dealership commercial.

00:01:15.705 --> 00:01:17.829
It was like amazing.

00:01:17.829 --> 00:01:18.662
- Right.

00:01:18.662 --> 00:01:19.740
You know, Kelly, we just
wanted to do something

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:22.110
that was fun, that would
catch people's attention.

00:01:22.110 --> 00:01:23.940
You know, we've got these cool vehicles,

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:25.650
we've got these mounted horses,

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:28.140
and we just wanted to
make a car commercial

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:30.600
that just looked fun to everybody.

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.600
And I'll tell you what, we
went to the chief on this

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:36.120
and he said, "You've never done
anything like this before."

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:37.770
And we're like, "Right,
Chief, we haven't."

00:01:37.770 --> 00:01:39.600
And he said, "Let's do it."

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.400
And so, I'm not an actor.

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:43.770
I had to memorize all these lines, Kelly.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:48.330
And we just made the character
of Big B as big as we could.

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:50.100
We wanted to grab everyone's attention

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:53.490
from all kind of cities around
here, including Burleson,

00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:55.080
which is about five minutes away from us.

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:56.850
- Yeah, well I was born in Fort Worth

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:58.620
and raised there half my life.

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:01.140
So you are making me proud right now, sir.

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:02.334
You are awesome.

00:02:02.334 --> 00:02:05.040
So, has it worked?

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:07.811
Like did you get a lot
of applicants after that?

00:02:07.811 --> 00:02:10.080
'Cause it made me think about it.

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:11.880
- Kelly, it's been absolutely amazing.

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:15.270
We had 1,127 applicants

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:18.459
and out of that 232 of those were females.

00:02:18.459 --> 00:02:21.720
This job is very serious, but
we wanted people to just know

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:24.090
behind this vest, behind this badge,

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:24.923
there's a human heart

00:02:24.923 --> 00:02:27.450
and you can have fun in
every job that you do.

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:28.800
- I love that.

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:32.310
You have the greatest
smile, by the way as well.

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:33.870
Thank you so much, Big B.

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:35.586
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:35.586 --> 00:02:36.938
(audience cheering)

00:02:36.938 --> 00:02:37.918
- [Big B] Thank you, Kelly.

00:02:37.918 --> 00:02:39.090
- Now I wanna close things up

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:41.790
with something special for one
lucky person in the audience.

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:43.920
Courtesy of our season
long partner Pilot Pen,

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:47.280
makers of G2, the go-to pen
of The Kelly Clarkson Show.

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:50.520
There is a check for $1,000 from Pilot

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:52.920
under someone's chair in this
audience taped underneath.

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:54.659
Go ahead, look for it.

00:02:54.659 --> 00:02:55.492
Go ahead!

00:02:57.225 --> 00:02:58.321
(person cheering)

00:02:58.321 --> 00:02:59.154
Yeah.

00:03:03.129 --> 00:03:04.726
Yeah.

00:03:04.726 --> 00:03:05.694
Hello.

00:03:05.694 --> 00:03:06.930
- Hello.

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:08.100
- What's your name?

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:09.030
Where are you from?

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:09.960
- My name is Jennifer.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:12.120
I'm from Monterey Park, California.

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:13.650
- Oh, nice to meet you, Jennifer.

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:15.540
What are you gonna do with your grand?

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:19.110
- I'm probably going to
save it for my education.

00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:20.010
- Oh, well that's good.

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:21.840
I was gonna say don't pay a bill with it,

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.711
but that's a good one actually.

00:03:23.711 --> 00:03:25.682
But good luck on your education.

00:03:25.682 --> 00:03:26.670
That's awesome.

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:27.503
- [Jennifer] Thank you so much.

00:03:27.503 --> 00:03:28.856
- That's opportunity.

00:03:28.856 --> 00:03:29.689
Thank you for coming.

00:03:29.689 --> 00:03:30.522
- [Jennifer] Thank you.

00:03:30.522 --> 00:03:32.280
- I'm so glad you, it looks
like you're still in shock.

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:33.998
So, I'm gonna not talk to you anymore.

00:03:33.998 --> 00:03:36.030
Okay, well thank you, Jennifer.

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:37.290
